--- task
id: t12
dataset: section8
kind: unbounded reachability
answer: fewest

--- intent
List the distinct names of everyone reachable from the person with handle `$from` by following `knows` edges any number of times.

--- params
{"from": "alice"}

--- edition3
query reachable($from: String) {
  match {
    from union(
      { match { $p: Person { handle: $from }  $p knows $q } return { $q } },
      { match { from reachable($from)  $q knows $r } return { $r as q } })
  }
  return distinct { $q }
}

query reachable_names($from: String) {
  match { from reachable($from) }
  return distinct { $q.name }
}

--- note
The recursive read returns the node column `$q`, since a relation drawn from must have variable-shaped columns (`T74`) and the recursion draws from itself; a second declaration projects the names.
